rd resting on the anti-static mat. LGA CPU socket with load lever, four DIMM slots (A1, A2, B1, B2), CPU_FAN and SYS_FAN headers, 24-pin ATX and 8-pin EPS power headers, SATA ports and the F_PANEL header.","description":"Motherboard"},{"id":"cpu","label":"Processor","imageAsset":"assets/COC1/Mission 2/cpu.png","inspection":"LGA processor in its tray. A gold triangle marks pin 1; it must match the triangle printed on the socket. Never touch the contacts.","description":"Processor"},{"id":"cooler","label":"CPU cooler","imageAsset":"assets/COC1/Mission 2/cooling_fan.png","inspection":"Tower cooler without pre-applied thermal compound. Its 4-pin fan cable must reach the CPU_FAN header.","description":"CPU cooler"},{"id":"ram","label":"Memory modules","imageAsset":"assets/COC1/Mission 2/ram.png","inspection":"Two identical DDR4 modules. The off-centre notch only lines up with the slot key one way round.","description":"Memory modules"},{"id":"psu","label":"Power supply","imageAsset":"assets/COC1/Mission 2/psu.png","inspection":"ATX power supply, switched off and unplugged. Modular 24-pin, 8-pin EPS and SATA power cables are attached.","description":"Power supply"},{"id":"storage","label":"Hard disk drive","imageAsset":"assets/COC1/Mission 2/hdd.png","inspection":"3.5-inch SATA hard disk drive with separate keyed SATA power and SATA data ports.","description":"Hard disk drive"}],"component":"tap_inspect","equipment":{"completion":[{"path":"inspected.system_case","value":true},{"path":"inspected.motherboard","value":true},{"path":"inspected.cpu","value":true},{"path":"inspected.cooler","value":true},{"path":"inspected.ram","value":true},{"path":"inspected.psu","value":true},{"path":"inspected.storage","value":true},{"path":"operation.wear_wrist_strap","value":true},{"path":"operation.ground_wrist_strap","value":true}],"operations":[{"id":"wear_wrist_strap","label":"Wear the anti-static wrist strap","effects":{"wrist_strap_worn":true},"requires":[]},{"id":"ground_wrist_stra